 rel="canonical" href="https://lulutechpark.com/terms-conditions"/><meta property="og:title" content="Terms and Conditions | Lulu IT Park"/><meta property="og:description" content="Lulu Tech Park&#x27;s rules for facility use and access."/><meta property="og:url" content="null"/><meta name="twitter:card" content="summary"/><meta name="twitter:title" content="Terms and Conditions | Lulu IT Park"/><meta name="twitter:description" content="Lulu Tech Park&#x27;s rules for facility use and access."/><link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon" sizes="16x16"/><meta name="next-size-adjust"/><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Organization","name":"Lulu IT Parks","url":"https://lulutechpark.com","logo":"https://lulutechpark.com/favicon.ico","sameAs":["https://www.facebook.com/lulutechparkpvtltd","https://www.linkedin.com/company/lulutechpark","https://x.com/lulutechpark"]}</script><script src="/_next/static/chunks/polyfills-42372ed130431b0a.js" noModule=""></script></head><body class="__className_78c81f antialiased"><div class="bg-[#001828] pt-16 md:pt-[92px]"><div class="max-xl:px-20 max-md:px-10 max-w-[964px] 2xl:max-w-[80%] mx-auto"><div class="relative py-8 md:py-[87px]"><div class="relative z-[1]"><h1 class="text-white mb-2 md:mb-4">Terms and Conditions</h1><p class="text-[#B2B9BE] max-w-[460px]">Welcome to Lulu IT Parks – The Future of Innovation and Collaboration</p></div><img alt="image" loading="lazy" width="100" height="100" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" class="w-full h-full max-w-[371px] max-h-[252px] z-[0] absolute bottom-0 right-[6%] lg:right-[22%]" style="color:transparent" src="/images/ribbon-transparent.svg"/></div></div></div><div class="terms max-xl:px-20 max-md:px-10 max-w-[964px] 2xl:max-w-[80%] mx-auto pt-10 md:pt-[60px] pb-5 md:pb-[100px] text-justify"><div><p>Lulu IT Parks is a premier destination for businesses in the Information Technology (IT) and IT-enabled Services (ITeS) sectors. Strategically located in key urban hubs, our state-of-the-art facilities are designed to foster innovation, collaboration, and growth.<br>With modern infrastructure, robust connectivity, and a suite of amenities tailored to meet the evolving needs of the IT industry, Lulu IT Parks offers an ideal environment for businesses to thrive. Whether you're a startup looking for scalable office solutions or an established enterprise aiming to expand, our versatile leasing options cater to diverse requirements. At Lulu IT Parks, we believe in creating more than just workplaces we build ecosystems that empower organizations to drive success, attract top talent, and redefine what's possible in the digital era. Discover a space where technology meets opportunity, and ideas come to life. Welcome to Lulu IT Parks a new standard in IT infrastructure.<br>&nbsp;</p><p>DISCLAIMER</p><ul><li>The content of this website is for general information purposes only. While enough care is taken by LULU IT PARKS to ensure that information on the website is up to date, accurate and correct, readers are requested to make their independent enquiry before relying upon the same. In no event will LULU IT PARKS offer any warranty on the information made available or be liable for any loss or damage including without limitation, indirect or consequential loss or damage in connection with, the use of information in this website. By using or accessing the website, you agree with the Disclaimer without any qualification or limitation.</li><li>The information depicted herein are subject to change without notifications as may be required by the relevant authorities or the developer’s architect, and cannot form part of an offer or contract. Whilst every care is taken in providing this information, the developer cannot be held liable for variations. All illustrations and pictures are artist’s impression only.</li><li>The contents of this website are meant to provide information to the readers of this website about us including our various projects, various initiatives taken by us, CSR activities etc., They are only for general information and are subject to change. By no stretch of imagination, the information on the website shall be construed as an advertisement and/or invitation or offer for sale.</li><li>The Site is provided on an “as-is” basis. We make no warranties, express or implied, regarding the accuracy, completeness, reliability, or availability of the Site or its content. We do not guarantee that the Site will be error-free or uninterrupted.</li></ul><p>Terms and Conditions</p><p>Welcome to LULU IT PARKS (hereinafter referred to as “Company, We, Our, us”). By accessing and using our website <a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" href="https://luluitparks.com">luluitparks.com</a>, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms and Conditions ("Terms"). If you do not agree with these Terms, please do not use the Site.</p><p>1. Acceptance of Terms</p><p>By using the Site, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms, including any updates or changes we may make from time to time. By browsing our website users are providing us consent to collect and process their data and by default, they are accepting the privacy policy described below.</p><p><br>2. Use of the Website</p><p>You agree to use the Site for lawful purposes only and in a manner that does not infringe on the rights of others or restrict their use of the Site. You must not:</p><ul><li>Violate any applicable laws or regulations.</li><li>Engage in fraudulent or deceptive practices.</li><li>Upload or transmit harmful files (viruses, malware, etc.).</li><li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to the Site’s systems.</li></ul><p>&nbsp;</p><p>3. Enquiry Process</p><p>You agree to provide accurate and updated information during the enquiry process.&nbsp;</p><p>4. Intellectual Property</p><p>The content on this Site, including text, images, logos, graphics, and software, is the property of LULU IT PARKS or its licensors and is protected by copyright and other intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, modify, or create derivative works from any content without our prior written permission.</p><p>5. Privacy Policy</p><p>Your use of the Site is also governed by our Privacy Policy, which outlines how we collect, use, and protect your personal information. By using the Site, you consent to the collection and use of your information in accordance with the Privacy Policy.</p><p>6. Third-Party Links</p><p>The Site may contain links to third-party websites. These links are provided for your convenience, and we do not control or endorse these external websites. We are not responsible for the content or practices of third-party websites.</p><p>7. Limitation of Liability</p><p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, LULU IT PARKS shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from the use or inability to use the Site, even if we have been advised of the possibility of such damages. LULU IT PARKS is not liable to fraudulent information’s, any offers, published, spam messages by any third parties in the name of LULU IT PARKS.</p><p>SOCIAL MEDIA We operate channels, pages and accounts on some social media sites to inform, assist and engage with customers. We monitor and record comments and posts made on these channels about us so that we can improve our services. LULU IT PARKS is not responsible for any information posted on those sites other than information we have posted us. We do not endorse the social media sites themselves, or any information posted on them by third parties.</p><p>CHILD PROTECTION Our sites or platforms are not directed towards children. If you are providing personal information for an individual less than 13 year of age, you are providing us your affirmative parental consent as the legal parent or guardian to collect, use and process the information of the individual less than 13 years of age, consistent with this Privacy Policy.</p><p>8. Indemnification<br>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless LULU IT PARKS, its officers, employees, and agents from any claims, damages, liabilities, costs, and expenses (including attorney fees) arising from your use of the Site, violation of these Terms, or infringement of any third-party rights.<br>9. Termination<br>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate your access to the Site at our discretion, with or without cause, and without prior notice, if you violate these Terms.<br>10. Governing Law<br>These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of Kerala, India, without regard to its conflict of law principles.<br>11. Dispute Resolution<br>Any disputes arising out of or in connection with these Terms will be resolved through [arbitration/mediation] in Ernakulam. By using the Site, you agree to submit to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Ernakulam.<br>12. Changes to Terms<br>We reserve the right to update or modify these Terms at any time. Any changes will be effective immediately upon posting the revised Terms on the Site. Please check this page regularly to stay informed of any updates</p><p><br>&nbsp;</p></div></div><a class="call-us-float-btn fixed  z-50 bottom-6 p-4 right-6 btn-style hover:scale-105  bg-[#c4942f] hover:bg-[#c4942f] text-white rounded-full shadow-lg flex items-center  transition-all duration-200  font-[500]" style="box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.15)" aria-label="Contact Us" href="tel:+917593812100"><svg stroke="currentColor" fill="currentColor" stroke-width="0" viewBox="0 0 512 512" class=" text-white" height="1em" width="1em" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M164.9 24.6c-7.7-18.6-28-28.5-47.4-23.2l-88 24C12.1 30.2 0 46 0 64C0 311.4 200.6 512 448 512c18 0 33.8-12.1 38.6-29.5l24-88c5.3-19.4-4.6-39.7-23.2-47.4l-96-40c-16.3-6.8-35.2-2.1-46.3 11.6L304.7 368C234.3 334.7 177.3 277.7 144 207.3L193.3 167c13.7-11.2 