te is up to date, accurate and correct, readers are requested to make their independent enquiry before relying upon the same. In no event will LULU IT PARKS offer any warranty on the information made available or be liable for any loss or damage including without limitation, indirect or consequential loss or damage in connection with, the use of information in this website. By using or accessing the website, you agree with the Disclaimer without any qualification or limitation.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eThe information depicted herein are subject to change without notifications as may be required by the relevant authorities or the developer’s architect, and cannot form part of an offer or contract. Whilst every care is taken in providing this information, the developer cannot be held liable for variations. All illustrations and pictures are artist’s impression only.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eThe contents of this website are meant to provide information to the readers of this website about us including our various projects, various initiatives taken by us, CSR activities etc., They are only for general information and are subject to change. By no stretch of imagination, the information on the website shall be construed as an advertisement and/or invitation or offer for sale.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eThe Site is provided on an “as-is” basis. We make no warranties, express or implied, regarding the accuracy, completeness, reliability, or availability of the Site or its content. We do not guarantee that the Site will be error-free or uninterrupted.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eTerms and Conditions\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWelcome to LULU IT PARKS (hereinafter referred to as “Company, We, Our, us”). By accessing and using our website \u003ca target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://luluitparks.com\"\u003eluluitparks.com\u003c/a\u003e, you agree to comply with and be bound by these Terms and Conditions (\"Terms\"). If you do not agree with these Terms, please do not use the Site.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e1. Acceptance of Terms\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBy using the Site, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms, including any updates or changes we may make from time to time. By browsing our website users are providing us consent to collect and process their data and by default, they are accepting the privacy policy described below.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e2. Use of the Website\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou agree to use the Site for lawful purposes only and in a manner that does not infringe on the rights of others or restrict their use of the Site. You must not:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003eViolate any applicable laws or regulations.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eEngage in fraudulent or deceptive practices.\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eUpload or transmit harmful files (viruses, malware, etc.).\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003eAttempt to gain unauthorized access to the Site’s systems.\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e3. Enquiry Process\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYou agree to provide accurate and updated information during the enquiry process.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e4. Intellectual Property\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe content on this Site, including text, images, logos, graphics, and software, is the property of LULU IT PARKS or its licensors and is protected by copyright and other intellectual property laws. You may not reproduce, distribute, modify, or create derivative works from any content without our prior written permission.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e5. Privacy Policy\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eYour use of the Site is also governed by our Privacy Policy, which outlines how we collect, use, and protect your personal information. By using the Site, you consent to the collection and use of your information in accordance with the Privacy Policy.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e6. Third-Party Links\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Site may contain links to third-party websites. These links are provided for your convenience, and we do not control or endorse these external websites. We are not responsible for the content or practices of third-party websites.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e7. Limitation of Liability\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTo the maximum extent permitted by law, LULU IT PARKS shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, special, or consequential damages arising from the use or inability to use the Site, even if we have been advised of the possibility of such damages. LULU IT PARKS is not liable to fraudulent information’s, any offers, published, spam messages by any third parties in the name of LULU IT PARKS.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSOCIAL MEDIA We operate channels, pages and accounts on some social media sites to inform, assist and engage with customers. We monitor and record comments and posts made on these channels about us so that we can improve our services. LULU IT PARKS is not responsible for any information posted on those sites other than information we have posted us. We do not endorse the social media sites themselves, or any information posted on them by third parties.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCHILD PROTECTION Our sites or platforms are not directed towards children. If you are providing personal information for an individual less than 13 year of age, you are providing us your affirmative parental consent as the legal parent or guardian to collect, use and process the information of the individual less than 13 years of age, consistent with this Privacy Policy.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e8. Indemnification\u003cbr\u003eYou agree to indemnify and hold harmless LULU IT PARKS, its officers, employees, and agents from any claims, damages, liabilities, costs, and expenses (including attorney fees) arising from your use of the Site, violation of these Terms, or infringement of any third-party rights.\u003cbr\u003e9. Termination\u003cbr\u003eWe reserve the right to suspend or terminate your access to the Site at our discretion, with or without cause, and without prior notice, if you violate these Terms.\u003cbr\u003e10. Governing Law\u003cbr\u003eThese Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of Kerala, India, without regard to its conflict of law principles.\u003cbr\u003e11. Dispute Resolution\u003cbr\u003eAny disputes arising out of or in connection with these Terms will be resolved through [arbitration/mediation] in Ernakulam. By using the Site, you agree to submit to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts of Ernakulam.\u003cbr\u003e12. Changes to Terms\u003cbr\u003eWe reserve the right to update or modify these Terms at any time. Any changes will be effective immediately upon posting the revised Terms on the Site. Please check this page regularly to stay informed of any updates\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"7:[null,[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"bg-[#001828] pt-16 md:pt-[92px]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"max-xl:px-20 max-md:px-10 max-w-[964px] 2xl:max-w-[80%] mx-auto\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative py-8 md:py-[87px]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative z-[1]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h1\",null,{\"className\":\"text-white mb-2 md:mb-4\",\"children\":\"Terms and Conditions\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-[#B2B9BE] max-w-[460px]\",\"children\":\"Welcome to Lulu IT Parks – The Future of Innovation and Collaboration\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{\"src\":\"/images/ribbon-transparent.svg\",\"alt\":\"image\",\"width\":100,\"height\":100,\"className\":\"w-full h-full max-w-[371px] max-h-[252px] z-[0] absolute bottom-0 right-[6%] lg:right-[22%]\"}]]}]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"terms max-xl:px-20 max-md:px-10 max-w-[964px] 2xl:max-w-[80%] mx-auto pt-10 md:pt-[60px] pb-5 md